{"storyMeta":{"storyReviewType":"NONE","storyId":"act40side_level_act40side_06_end","storyGroup":"act40side","storySort":12,"storyDependence":"act40side_level_act40side_06_beg","storyCanShow":1,"storyCode":"OR-6","storyName":"胜肉火方","storyPic":null,"storyInfo":"煌和惊蛰重新聚首，二人决定前往百珍宴。另一方面，对于炎国朝廷来说，岁兽一事已经到了不得不得出结论的时候，真龙即将在百珍宴上宣布他的决定。","storyCanEnter":1,"storyTxt":"activities/act40side/level_act40side_06_end","avgTag":"行动后","unLockType":"BY_START_TIME","costItemType":"NONE","costItemId":null,"costItemCount":0,"stageCount":1,"requiredStages":[{"stageId":"act40side_06","minState":"PASS","maxState":"COMPLETE"}],"prev":10,"next":12,"characters":["宁述","宁茵","大理寺官员A","大理寺官员B","煌","麟青砚","太傅","太尉","帷幕后的声音","太傅&太尉","老姜"]},"lines":[{"type":"header","key":"title_test","skippable":"true","mode":"BLACK_MASK","id":0},{"type":"stopmusic","id":1},{"type":"dialog","id":2},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":3},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":4},{"type":"charslot","id":5},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$loneliness_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/static/m_avg/m_avg_loneliness_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":6,"musicid":0},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/2/28/Avg_bg_58_g12_ningfucourtyard.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":7},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":8},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":9},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","duration":"1","id":10},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#3$1","duration":"1","id":11},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":12},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":13},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"你那位朋友这么快就走了？也不留人家吃个饭？","id":14,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_1614_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":15},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"嗯......她还有别的要紧事，没法久留啦。","id":16,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1D/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":17},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"从小到大，都不见你带朋友回来，还想着可以认识一下。","id":18,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_1614_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":19},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"或许，也算不上是朋友......","id":20,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/1D/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":21},{"type":"text","text":"老人看着垂头丧气的宁茵，想说些什么，却终究没有开口，只是伸手拂去了她肩头的落叶。","id":22},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#3$1","focus":"n","id":23},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":24},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"快要走了，还有好多事放不下吧？","id":25,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_1614_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":26},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"......爷爷也是吗？","id":27,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":28},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"呵呵，前些日子总盼着赶紧回去，真要走了，看着这一草一木，又都放不下了。","id":29,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_1614_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"还记得吗？当年就在这亭子里，铺一层沙，拾一根棍，一笔一画地教你写字。","id":30,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_1614_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"你当时和我说，来年，府上所有的对联都要由你来写。我陪你练了两个月，最后你自己坚持不下去了。","id":31,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_1614_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":32},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"结果第二年，你还真送了我一副对联。","id":33,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DE/Avg_avg_npc_1614_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"“花好月圆吃得饱，天长地久......”","id":34,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DE/Avg_avg_npc_1614_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":35},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"这些事，爷爷都还记得。","id":36,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":37},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"哪能忘呢......又是一年中秋，日子过得真快啊。","id":38,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DE/Avg_avg_npc_1614_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":39},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_wind","volume":"1","id":40},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":41},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":42},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"我们爷孙两个是不是很久没这样聊过天了？","id":43,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DE/Avg_avg_npc_1614_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":44},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"......嗯。最近我一直出门在外，爷爷您也忙着接待客人，见面的机会都很少。","id":45,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6D/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":46},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"这次举家离京，折腾得不轻。","id":47,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_npc_1614_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"不过回到琅珆就清净了，路上也有大把时间让我们谈天说地。","id":48,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/09/Avg_avg_npc_1614_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":49},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":50},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#8$1","focus":"r","id":51},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"你自己的那本书，终于要写完了？","id":52,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DE/Avg_avg_npc_1614_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":53},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"......","id":54,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6D/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"爷爷，我可能......不能和你一起回琅珆了。","id":55,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6D/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":56},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"......何时做的决定？","id":57,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_1614_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","id":58},{"type":"text","text":"宁茵轻轻摇头，身子却往后退了几步。","id":59},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","focus":"n","id":60},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":61},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"爷爷此次归乡，是叶落归根，人之常情，家里人都非常明白。然而路途遥远，换谁也放心不下。","id":62,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6D/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"宁家人才辈出，每个人都为大炎做着举足轻重的工作。相比下来，若要有一个人陪您回去，没人比我更合适。","id":63,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6D/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":64},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"不过话说回来，我本就是琅珆远房遗孤出身，多亏爷爷怜悯，才能在这宁府住了几十年。","id":65,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/60/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"如今前往琅珆，也算是回到父母生前故居了。","id":66,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/60/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":67},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"当时你主动要求陪我回乡......是这么想的？","id":68,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/68/Avg_avg_npc_1614_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":69},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"......爷爷，我本来是这么想的。","id":70,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6D/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"一切都合情合理，我几乎都要说服自己了。","id":71,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6D/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":72},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"但这几日，为了给《百灶食珍录》结尾，我抱着告别的心思，又一次游历了百灶的大街小巷。","id":73,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"......可我发现自己所有的回忆，都与这座城市有关。","id":74,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"我能清楚地记得，院中那棵柿树是哪年栽下的，何时的果子最适合酿酒。","id":75,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"还有街头巷尾的各家餐馆，它们的厨师各自有什么样的脾性，同一道菜又有多少种不同的做法。","id":76,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"我突然发现，比起这座宁府的宅子，这座城市，才更像是我的家。","id":77,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":78},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"唉......","id":79,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0D/Avg_avg_npc_1614_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"......怪我，怪我没有早些问你的想法。这阵子都是我自作主张了。","id":80,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0D/Avg_avg_npc_1614_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":81},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"爷爷，从小到大，您就是我唯一的亲人。","id":82,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"当初我的确想和您回故乡，而如今坚持留在百灶......也是因为爷爷您。","id":83,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#5$1","focus":"r","id":84},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"因为我？","id":85,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0D/Avg_avg_npc_1614_1-5$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":86},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"......嗯。","id":87,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6D/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":88},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"我最开始加入太史阁，参与编写史书时，有件事一直让我百思不得其解。","id":89,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"大炎数千年的历史，突然从某个节点开始，推广文字，普及教育。一些研究用的碑文，最早也就能追溯到那个时期。","id":90,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"我想，在那个时代，一定有人推动了这些变革。可我翻阅了几乎所有资料，却找不到一丝线索。","id":91,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"我有一种奇怪的感觉，大炎的史书上，仿佛缺失了一个人。","id":92,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1614_1#6$1","focus":"r","id":93},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁述","text":"......","id":94,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A7/Avg_avg_npc_1614_1-6$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":95},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"直到有次，我在一间棋馆遇到了个怪人，他和我讲了关于“那个人”的故事。","id":96,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"我原先以为他只是个故弄玄虚的说书人，可是在后续的研究中，我渐渐发现，他和我说的那些故事，居然一一被印证了。","id":97,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"在他的叙述里，“她”是个温柔的人，为天下苍生，付出了太多心血......可为何这样一个好人，却没法在史书上留下一个名字？","id":98,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BC/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":99},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"那时我才意识到，原来史书从来不是一个容器，而是一把筛子。能留下的故事，少之又少。","id":100,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6D/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":101},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":102},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_4172_xingzh_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":103},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"爷爷......我想要记录下您的故事。可是我回过头来，却突然发现，与您相伴几十年，我竟然都没有办法清晰地写下您......","id":104,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6D/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"宁茵","text":"写下您，是一个什么样的人。","id":105,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/6D/Avg_avg_4172_xingzh_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":106},{"type":"charslot","id":107},{"type":"text","text":"宁茵终于抬起头，直视着老人的眼睛。","id":108},{"type":"text","text":"她期待着老人会回答，回答她没有说出口的疑问。","id":109},{"type":"text","text":"她等了很久。","id":110},{"type":"dialog","id":111},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":112},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":113},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":114},{"type":"charslot","id":115},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F3/Avg_bg_58_g4_baizaomainstreet_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":116},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":117},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_reedmarshes","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"r","id":118},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":119},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":120},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$ponder_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/act15d0d0/m_avg_ponder_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":121,"musicid":1},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"r","fadetime":"2","id":122},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":123},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1631_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":124},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大理寺官员A","text":"有动静！","id":125,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B6/Avg_avg_npc_1631_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":126},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"r","id":127},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"r","fadetime":"1","id":128},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1632_1#1$1","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1","id":129},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":130},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1632_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":131},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大理寺官员B","text":"哪有动静？","id":132,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_1632_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1631_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":133},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大理寺官员A","text":"嘶......总觉得听到了什么。","id":134,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B6/Avg_avg_npc_1631_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大理寺官员A","text":"可能是这几天见的古怪案子太多了，总觉得不知道什么时候就有人要跑来闹事。","id":135,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B6/Avg_avg_npc_1631_1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1632_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":136},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大理寺官员B","text":"这可是大理寺，哪个拎不清的敢闯这里？","id":137,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_1632_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"大理寺官员B","text":"别神神道道的了，站完这班岗赶快下班回家了。","id":138,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/6/65/Avg_avg_npc_1632_1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":139},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":140},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1632_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-400,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"2","id":141},{"type":"delay","time":"3","id":142},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","id":143},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_npc_1631_1#1$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-300,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"0.8","id":144},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":145},{"type":"charslot","id":146},{"type":"delay","time":"2.5","id":147},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":148},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","bstart":"0.2","bend":"0.7","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.5","id":149},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":150},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"-200,0","duration":"1.5","isCopy":"true","id":151},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"1.5","id":152},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":153},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"待会先从正门进......就说自己是来报案的，再在去等候室的路上找到楼层的地图......","id":154},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"昨天那个等候室的窗户朝北，大理寺正门朝南，背面是高筑的围墙。","id":155},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"麟青砚的办公室在三楼......从窗户翻出去，顺着消防管道往上爬，不会被发现。","id":156},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#9$1","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"-200,0","duration":"0","id":157},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"等找到那家伙，*炎国粗口*先给她一拳......！","id":158,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/59/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":159},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_snowstormflp","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"sn","id":160},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"1","id":161},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_breezetree","volume":"1","id":162},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":163},{"type":"camerashake","duration":"0.3","xstrength":"30","ystrength":"30","vibrato":"30","randomness":"90","fadeout":"true","block":"false","id":164},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#10$1","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"-200,0","duration":"0","id":165},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"谁？！","id":166,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/E/EF/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":167},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_clothmovementsp","volume":"1","id":168},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#9$1","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"200,15","duration":"0.5","id":169},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":170},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":171},{"type":"charslot","id":172},{"type":"background","id":173},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":174},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":175},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.03","block":"true","id":176},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_punchsp3","volume":"1","id":177},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.03","block":"true","id":178},{"type":"delay","time":"0.1","id":179},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.03","block":"true","id":180},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_punchsp5","volume":"1","id":181},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.03","block":"true","id":182},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":183},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":184},{"type":"charslot","id":185},{"type":"background","id":186},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/F3/Avg_bg_58_g4_baizaomainstreet_n.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":187},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_axehitscrape","volume":"1","id":188},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.1","block":"true","id":189},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_scratchmetalwall","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"sc","id":190},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"sc","fadetime":"1.5","id":191},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1644_1#12$1","posfrom":"-600,0","posto":"40,-20","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":192},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":193},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","posfrom":"40,-20","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.5","isblock":"true","id":194},{"type":"delay","time":"0.5","id":195},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"w","id":196},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"w","fadetime":"1.5","id":197},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#11$1","posfrom":"-200,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1.5","id":198},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":199},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":200},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"麟青砚？！","id":201,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1644_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":202},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"煌？！","id":203,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DF/Avg_avg_npc_1644_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"你怎么在这？！","id":204,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/DF/Avg_avg_npc_1644_1-10$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":205},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"我怎么在这？我来抓你回去！","id":206,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/59/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"你那身官服去哪了？","id":207,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/59/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1644_1#16$1","focus":"r","id":208},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"我辞官了。","id":209,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_1644_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"回到酒店看到你人不在，就怕你做蠢事，还真是怕什么来什么。","id":210,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_1644_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"......我们换个地方再说！","id":211,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/BF/Avg_avg_npc_1644_1-16$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":212},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"sn","fadetime":"2","id":213},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":214},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":215},{"type":"charslot","id":216},{"type":"playmusic","intro":"$darkness01_intro","key":"https://static.prts.wiki/music/music/beta1_180603/m_dia_darkness01_loop.mp3","volume":"0.6","id":217,"musicid":2},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/5A/Avg_bg_35_g13_yanlivingroom.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":218},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":219},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_drkcludsthdr","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"d","id":220},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.3","channel":"d","fadetime":"2","id":221},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":222},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":223},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1644_1#10$1","focus":"r","id":224},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#9$1","focus":"n","id":225},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"你是说，这么多年以来，顾筌其实一直都停留在宁府？","id":226},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"可你是怎么打听到的......","id":227},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":228},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"你就别管那么多了。你能不能直接告诉我，这到底意味着什么？","id":229,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/59/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1644_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":230},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"宁尚书与顾筌一案的牵扯比我想象的还要深，之前他的证言显然有所隐瞒。","id":231,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C1/Avg_avg_npc_1644_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"虽然我一度怀疑过他就是行凶者，可是按莫不服的证词，如果顾筌当年为旧案伸冤而被打入死狱，而宁述是救他出来的那个人......","id":232,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C1/Avg_avg_npc_1644_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"那他便没有动机再次谋害他。","id":233,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C1/Avg_avg_npc_1644_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1644_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":234},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"最关键的是......我之前从不知道，虞澄竟然早已与顾筌有过接触。","id":235,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FB/Avg_avg_npc_1644_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"这一系列事背后的关联，可能比我想象的还要复杂。","id":236,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FB/Avg_avg_npc_1644_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":237},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"我还是很好奇，我爸当年孤身一人来到百灶，他到底是想做什么？","id":238,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1644_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":239},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"这才是最关键的问题......","id":240,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FB/Avg_avg_npc_1644_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1644_1#4$1","focus":"r","id":241},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"（煌对于顾筌的两段人生一无所知......如果顾筌的确是当年案件的受牵连者，又为何要在十几年后回到百灶，将自己置于漩涡中央？）","id":242,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_1644_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"（宁述的立场、虞澄的谋划......这些问题还是没有头绪。）","id":243,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_1644_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"（我又该如何让煌知道......）","id":244,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/37/Avg_avg_npc_1644_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#11$1","focus":"l","id":245},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"喂，你干嘛又是一副欲言又止的表情？","id":246,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"那我们接下来到底该怎么办？","id":247,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/58/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-11$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1644_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":248},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"煌，昨天的事......","id":249,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_npc_1644_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#3$1","focus":"l","id":250},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"算了，我知道你们“职责在身”的人，时不时就要干点不正常的事，都懒得和你们计较。","id":251,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8A/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"只要你别再说什么为了我的安全，让我一个人回去之类的蠢话——","id":252,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/8/8A/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1644_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":253},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"......","id":254,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_npc_1644_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":255},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"你还打算赶我走？？","id":256,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/59/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1644_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":257},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"煌，你相信我，这件事，我一定会一查到底......只是，你不能继续留在百灶了。","id":258,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FB/Avg_avg_npc_1644_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"按我之前说的，两天内离开百灶，先去龙门的办事处。那里也不是久留之地，你整顿好就立刻再启程，尽快离开炎国——","id":259,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FB/Avg_avg_npc_1644_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":260},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"我绝不。","id":261,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/59/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1644_1#2$1","focus":"r","id":262},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"你不相信我会继续追查下去？","id":263,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/A/A9/Avg_avg_npc_1644_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#9$1","focus":"l","id":264},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"我倒是信你，可你自己一个人没有官衔，没有身份，还怎么查案？","id":265,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/5/59/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1644_1#3$1","focus":"r","id":266},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"......我会想办法。","id":267,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C1/Avg_avg_npc_1644_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"虞澄可以辞官暗中调查，我也——","id":268,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C1/Avg_avg_npc_1644_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#1$1","focus":"l","id":269},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"我有一个主意。","id":270,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"咱们不如做得彻底一点。","id":271,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/34/Avg_avg_1040_blaze2_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1644_1#1$1","focus":"r","id":272},{"type":"dialogue","name":"麟青砚","text":"......你想怎么做？","id":273,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/F/FB/Avg_avg_npc_1644_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":274},{"type":"charslot","id":275},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_paper1","volume":"1","id":276},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":277},{"type":"text","text":"煌从口袋中掏出了一封信。","id":278},{"type":"text","text":"那是莫不服给她的机会，现在成了她们两人的机会。","id":279},{"type":"charslot","slot":"l","name":"avg_1040_blaze2_1#2$1","focus":"l","id":280},{"type":"charslot","slot":"r","name":"avg_npc_1644_1#1$1","focus":"n","id":281},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"反正我们东奔西跑也问不出个结果。","id":282},{"type":"dialogue","name":"煌","text":"我们去百珍宴，直接找真龙问个清楚。","id":283},{"type":"dialog","id":284},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_thunders_amb","volume":"1","id":285},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":286},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.03","block":"true","id":287},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":288},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.03","block":"true","id":289},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":290},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":291},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":292},{"type":"charslot","id":293},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/D/D3/Avg_bg_58_g5_dragonpalace.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":294},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":295},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":296},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":297},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_301_1#1$1","id":298},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"陛下，这是礼部拟好的百珍宴与会官员的名单。","id":299,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"时值佳节，维多利亚、莱塔尼亚、拉特兰等国也遣使节送来贺帖。","id":300,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"请陛下过目。","id":301,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1239_1#8$1","id":302},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太尉","text":"咳咳......咳咳咳......","id":303,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7E/Avg_avg_npc_1239_1-8$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1239_1#1$1","id":304},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太尉","text":"陛下......兵部协同司岁台已经拟定了完整的作战计划。","id":305,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C1/Avg_avg_npc_1239_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太尉","text":"还请陛下......咳咳......过目。","id":306,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C1/Avg_avg_npc_1239_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_301_1#1$1","id":307},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"作战耗费的人力财力、战后恢复诸事，都没有与户部商议过，这作战计划是如何拟定的？","id":308,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1239_1#1$1","id":309},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太尉","text":"知道太傅大人和户部繁忙，兵部就多操了一点心，打这一仗要用的人力钱粮，乃至工部战后修复的花销，这笔账我们都算清楚了。","id":310,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C1/Avg_avg_npc_1239_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太尉","text":"正好，当着陛下的面，太傅大人一块儿看了吧。","id":311,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C1/Avg_avg_npc_1239_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_301_1#3$1","id":312},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"钱粮物资能算，战事一起，大炎子民要流多少血，这也是一笔能算清的账？","id":313,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B2/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1239_1#4$1","id":314},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太尉","text":"那太傅的意思是，算不清，就不用算了？","id":315,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7F/Avg_avg_npc_1239_1-4$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":316},{"type":"charslot","id":317},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_chairrub","volume":"0.3","id":318},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":319},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_wtchkgopenftstp","volume":"1","loop":"true","channel":"wt","id":320},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":321},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"wt","fadetime":"2","id":322},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_301_1#1$1","id":323},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"......","id":324,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1239_1#1$1","id":325},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太尉","text":"......","id":326,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C1/Avg_avg_npc_1239_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":327},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帷幕后的声音","text":"秋天了......今年北方的收成怎么样？","id":328},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_301_1#1$1","id":329},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"那场灾害过后，大荒城已经尽快恢复了生产。今年的收成，和以往数年相差不多。","id":330,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":331},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帷幕后的声音","text":"那......明年呢？","id":332},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_301_1#2$1","id":333},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"陛下......","id":334,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/0D/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-2$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","focus":"n","id":335},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帷幕后的声音","text":"生年不满百，常怀千岁忧......可时间不多了。","id":336},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_301_1#1$1","id":337},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"事系大炎万民生计，请陛下三思。","id":338,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1239_1#1$1","id":339},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太尉","text":"太傅大人，该议的事，内阁六部，早都不知道议了多少遍，总该到了拿主意的时候。","id":340,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C1/Avg_avg_npc_1239_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太尉","text":"陛下圣意已决，百珍宴上，等陛下宣布即可。","id":341,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/C/C1/Avg_avg_npc_1239_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_301_1#1$1","id":342},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅","text":"......","id":343,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/1/13/Avg_avg_npc_301_1-1$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":344},{"type":"charslot","duration":"0.5","isblock":"true","id":345},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帷幕后的声音","text":"天色晚了，眼看要下雨的。","id":346},{"type":"dialogue","name":"帷幕后的声音","text":"......二位请回吧。","id":347},{"type":"dialogue","name":"太傅&太尉","text":"臣告退。","id":348},{"type":"dialog","id":349},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":350},{"type":"delay","time":"2","id":351},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_thunders_amb","volume":"1","id":352},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":353},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.03","block":"true","id":354},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"255","g":"255","b":"255","fadetime":"0.5","block":"true","id":355},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0.03","block":"true","id":356},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":357},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_rainlight_loop","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"ra","id":358},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"ra","fadetime":"2","id":359},{"type":"text","text":"帷幕后的人抬眼望去——","id":360},{"type":"text","text":"空荡荡的宫殿，高位之侧，三张坐席并列摆设，居中的那张已经陈旧。","id":361},{"type":"text","text":"一声幽微的叹息。","id":362},{"type":"dialog","id":363},{"type":"stopmusic","fadetime":"2","id":364},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":365},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":366},{"type":"charslot","id":367},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/0/05/Avg_bg_58_g1_yusrestaurant.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":368},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":369},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.5","channel":"ra","fadetime":"2","id":370},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":371},{"type":"playsound","key":"$rungeneral","volume":"1","id":372},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":373},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1621_1#9$1","posfrom":"200,0","posto":"0,0","duration":"1","isblock":"true","id":374},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老姜","text":"哎哟哎哟......这雨怎么说下就下，淋我一身......","id":375,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7B/Avg_avg_npc_1621_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老姜","text":"一场秋雨一场寒......再过几天都吃不上新鲜蔬菜咯。今年冬天的衣服都还没来得及准备呢......","id":376,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7B/Avg_avg_npc_1621_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老姜","text":"大厨，今年的冬菜说什么也得提前开始存了，你趁早把仓库里你那些乱七八糟的东西——","id":377,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/7/7B/Avg_avg_npc_1621_1-9$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":378},{"type":"delay","time":"1.5","id":379},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1621_1#3$1","id":380},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老姜","text":"大厨......？","id":381,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B6/Avg_avg_npc_1621_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialogue","name":"老姜","text":"煌小姐？行箸姑娘？人呢......？","id":382,"figure":"https://media.prts.wiki/B/B6/Avg_avg_npc_1621_1-3$1.png"},{"type":"dialog","id":383},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":384},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1621_1#3$1","posfrom":"0,0","posto":"-200,0","afrom":"1","ato":"0","duration":"2","isblock":"true","id":385},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"d","fadetime":"2","id":386},{"type":"stopsound","channel":"ra","fadetime":"2","id":387},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"0","block":"true","id":388},{"type":"blocker","a":"1","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":389},{"type":"charslot","id":390},{"type":"background","image":"https://media.prts.wiki/3/3A/Avg_bg_58_g13_yuskitchen.png","screenadapt":"coverall","id":391},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_avg_makesoup","volume":"0","loop":"true","channel":"m","id":392},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"0.5","channel":"m","fadetime":"2","id":393},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":394},{"type":"blocker","a":"0","r":"0","g":"0","b":"0","fadetime":"2","block":"true","id":395},{"type":"delay","time":"1","id":396},{"type":"soundvolume","volume":"1","channel":"m","fadetime":"2","id":397},{"type":"text","text":"平常热闹的后厨此时空无一人，厨具也被归置整齐，局促的空间看上去竟宽敞了不少。","id":398},{"type":"text","text":"只有灶火上炖着一锅汤。","id":399},{"type":"dialog","id":400},{"type":"playsound","key":"$d_gen_walk_n","volume":"1","id":401},{"type":"charslot","slot":"m","name":"avg_npc_1621_1#2$